<name>Electronically Controlled Automatic Transaxle [ECT] (U660E)</name>
<para id="RM000000AVY022X" category="J" type-id="302UJ" name-id="261IJ-01" from="200912">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Sport Sequential Shift Switch Circuit</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000AVY022X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FRS00001">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>When the shift lever position is in the M position, any gear can be selected using the sequential gate of the floor shift or the transmission shift switch on the steering assembly.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000AVY022X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FRT00001">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C223487J01" width="7.106578999in" height="4.7836529in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000AVY022X_03" type-id="51" category="05">
